2
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:06,000
The Infiltrators is a science fiction, horror film directed by Gary Whitson.

3
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:36,000
Empress Zarina rules the country of Feminia using her
Imperial Guard Corp Clones as her army.

4
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
All males are slaves except for those who have joined the resistance, made
up mostly of a woman who hates the policies of the Empress.

5
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:36,000
Amanda (Debbie D) Sharpe and Michelle (Laura Giglio) use plastic surgery to make themselves look like
two of the Imperial Clones so that they can infiltrate the enemy and learn their secrets.

6
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
But they must defeat General Kala (Pamela Sutch) and Captain Zara
(Barbara Joyce) in order for their mission to be successful.

7
